  "title": "In STM32 Cube IDE code is not generated for whatever board I select.",
  "content": "<p>I am following these steps :- </p><p>Create STM32 Project<br />File → New → STM32 Project<br />Select STM32L476RGTx (LQFP64) MCU/board → Next → Finish<br />Open the .ioc file<br />Configure LED1<br />In Pinout &amp; Configuration, <br />Set PA2 to GPIO_Output, then click on project → generate code ( The ‘main.c’ file is not generate for given MCU and also for other MCU for similar steps code is not generating). </p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/0ebe88e5-ecc9-45a0-adf2-2e3dad56b915.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/8f760126-8cf2-4774-b215-08608eee7f0e.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/c61b2121-35f1-4d42-a360-4294015a4e27.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/32ffafeb-4eed-43ac-bd4d-77c6483d9a19.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/cd6e1d77-a422-4eeb-b7ae-2173272bb1e6.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/7b0a7e4f-57ca-4124-8dc7-eea5b535d6c9.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/30aa4c2a-a159-429d-a454-3cc1ebc71c12.png\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/e6a56b7d-febe-4e0d-9ae1-3aa7a3ab2dad.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
