      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hi,</p><p>you have a warning:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/0111ea1a-7fbe-43ba-9eb7-85094e108408.png\"/></figure><p>check in project - &gt; properties  - &gt; resource … UTF-8</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/b9b697b1-79a0-4503-8a3d-0c962ba23211.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p>and have the swd debug set :</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/65e6c97c-f431-43d0-8304-c44b5081e19a.png\"/></figure><ul><li>here on F303 , SYS,  on other cpu debug setting might be under : debug, etc.</li></ul><p>+</p><p>maybe it cannot download cpu database , because you have to be logged in :</p><p>log in in menu - &gt; Help - &gt; stmCube updates - &gt; connection to st</p><p> </p></div>"
